"className":"doc-intro","children":"Apparent started as a fix for one family's mornings. Chore charts worked for two weeks. Checklists worked for one. Then the household ran on repeated requests again."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"So one parent built the loop the family needed: set the day once, let the kid see what's next, approve only what needed a look, and keep the rewards honest. Along the way came the published research on rewards and motivation, and most of what it said was “build less.” Apparent is what's left."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/what-we-left-out","children":"Read what we left out, and why"}],"."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"doc-section","id":"who","aria-labelledby":"who-title","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"kicker","children":"The company"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"who-title","children":"Who makes it"}],"$L16","$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}]]}]}]]}],"$L1b"]
